  "description": "Two Worlds. One Ride. Remember the early days of mountain biking when John Tomac rode his MTB and drop bar from victory to victory? Those days are back! After all, where does gravel start and mountainbiking end? Today on gravel, tomorrow on a singletrack. Enjoy the best of both worlds on one bike. Feel the sun, feel the wind and experience your next gravel ride with the advantages of the X-MYROON mountainbike. From sandy trails to uneven terrain, this bike is designed for speed and control on any surface. Whether it's the Leadville 100, a beach bike race or your own personal gravel adventure, this bike is your perfect companion. Compared to other gravel and mountain bikes, the X-MYROON offers a unique combination of comfort and performance. While many gravel bikes focus on speed and lightness, the X-MYROON offers the robustness and stability of a mountainbike. The 100mm fork travel and 29 inch MTB tyres ensure optimum grip and stability. In addition, the 1x12 Shimano GRX gears offer precision and reliability unrivalled in this class. Exper ience boundless freedom and countless opportunities to explore new horizons. With the new X-MYROON you are ready for any terrain, anytime, anywhere.",
